## create project on command line

Open your command line app (terminal) to create a new directory for
the project, then to initialize a Python virtual environment.

```console
mkdir bot_name
cd bot_name

# creates a virtual environment
python -m venv .venv

# activate the environment
source .venv/bin/activate

# on windows
.venv\Scripts\activate

# to deactivate it (when you're done, but not necessary!)
source deactivate

